    },
    {
      "id": "claim_daeb296ce8864d4787a9b18f46f83fe0",
      "statement": "Fleet discovery and authority rest on two per-lease bucket JSON record families: node leases at `nodes/<node>.json` (carrying expires_ms, advertise address, probe public key, peer protocol, paced_handoff flag, generation, load sample, and folded node-log state) and cell ownership records at `cells/<cell>/own.json` (node name plus epoch).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/ownership_store.rs#L288-L420",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e934983f1db214fae113788119255b039e63217029245257e9aa51a03bddb451:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/ownership_store.rs#L442-L455",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:848e2158e28136f87209418e1454e3aa10a8cb5775b0860c614fe3c1176f578e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_79ee046daf8f446685d2267f97fb5281",
      "statement": "Cell ownership is transferred through CAS writes: `cas_owner` guards with `CasGuard::Absent` (create-only) or `CasGuard::Match(etag)` (compare-and-swap), and `release_owner` uses read-then-conditional-write so a node cannot blank another live owner's record; this is what guarantees exactly one node owns a cell at a time.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/ownership_store.rs#L379-L420",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:78ae6b8040d4fca3fdd87e1fa4277efb0e170ebbf13bb715a436b7a0fee1d060:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_249dfe00a92b429ab69e12d66c2962de",
      "statement": "Placement reads the live fleet pattern via `read_capacity_peers()`, which lists `nodes/`, skips stale-leases (records not rewritten within a lease lifetime), and loads leases with bounded I/O concurrency of 16; a second dedicated bucket client (user agent `celld-lease`) isolates lease traffic from ownership/deployment/replication traffic.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/celld/bucket.rs",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:a948fa37ecbd946cd8040996e91f2fd006cb01e8d81f9a1a7393573ed0154f68"
        },
        {
